    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Ring, Rare</em></p><p>This ring has 3 charges, and it regains 1d3 expended charges daily at dawn. While wearing the ring, you can expend 1 charge to cast one of the following spells (save DC 13) from it:</p><ul><li class=\"Core-Styles_Core-Bulleted\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd-players-handbook.spells.Item.phbsplAnimalFrie]{Animal Friendship}</li><li class=\"Core-Styles_Core-Bulleted\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd-players-handbook.spells.Item.phbsplFear000000]{Fear} (affects Beasts only)</li><li class=\"Core-Styles_Core-Bulleted\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd-players-handbook.spells.Item.phbsplSpeakwithA]{Speak with Animals}</li></ul>",
